{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"440","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Forgotten Episode"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Polycarpus adores TV series. Right now he is ready to finish watching a season of a popular sitcom \"Graph Theory\". In total, the season has "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" episodes, numbered with integers from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Polycarpus watches episodes not one by one but in a random order. He has already watched all the episodes except for one. Which episode has Polycaprus forgotten to watch?"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(2 ≤ n ≤ 100000)"},{"kind":"text","text":" — the number of episodes in a season. Assume that the episodes are numbered by integers from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n - 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a1, a2, ..., an"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(1 ≤ ai ≤ n)"},{"kind":"text","text":" — the numbers of episodes that Polycarpus has watched. All values of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":" are distinct."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print the number of the episode that Polycarpus hasn't watched."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"10\n3 8 10 1 7 9 6 5 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"440A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/440/problem/A"}